# Solaceon Town (the original's CITY06 role): the farming town on the plateau, with the Pokémon Day Care and the
# old ruins under the hill. A homely G-major pastorale rocking gently in six-eight: a fiddling violin in a
# siciliano's lilt over an accordion's soft after-beats and a bass swinging from root to fifth; the clarinet
# takes the tune for a verse and hums along under it when it comes back. By night the ocarina and the horn over
# a celesta's after-beats, like a music box. Original composition for this game.
title Solaceon Town
tempo 108
meter 6/8
reverb 0.3
nighttempo 0.94

